title: Johannes Stelling
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, reformist
card-image: img/portraits/StellingJohannes.jpg
view-if: stelling_advisor = 1 and stelling_dead = 0
new-page: true

= Johannes Stelling

Stelling is [? if chancellor = "Stelling": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Stelling": the current President and ?] …

- @reichsbanner
- @democracy
- @chancellor
- @president
- @debug_never
- @root: Return to main

@reichsbanner
title: Turn our attention to the Reichsbanner
go-to: reichsbanner

@democracy
title: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against dictatorship and fascism.
on-arrival: democratization += 1; pro_republic += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; pro_republic += 4*(1 - dissent) if democratization >= 3; new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3 

Our speakers defend the republican system and rail against the monarchists and authoritarians who threaten it.

[? if democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the workers as much as more practical issues. But that may change; part of our job is to provide political education to the proletariat. ?]
[? if democratization >= 3 : Since we have consistently made democratization a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Stelling" : Stelling must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Stelling")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@debug_never
title: DEBUG: Never
subtitle: Never = 1
view-if: legislature_enabled
on-arrival: never = 1

Never enabled

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Stelling can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Stelling"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Stelling can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Stelling"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: reichsexekution
